        "original_id": "545079fb-0433-50fb-ba6e-bdbb913e3ea0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Lightfoot, Ivan Milat, Bradley Murdoch\n- Works: Wolf Creek, Rogue\n- Topics: horror films, film marketing, true-events claims, real-life murder inspirations\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1990s, Ivan Milat murdered tourists in crimes that later echoed elements of the plot of Wolf Creek.\n- In 2001, Bradley Murdoch committed a real-life tourist murder that later echoed elements of the plot of Wolf Creek.\n- Wolf Creek was ambiguously marketed as being based on true events.\n- David Lightfoot worked on the horror films Wolf Creek and Rogue.\n- The plot of Wolf Creek bore elements reminiscent of the real-life murders associated with Ivan Milat and Bradley Murdoch.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
